        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Edge Class Page\n\nThe page for an edge class definition, at detail size. It has three sections: **Settings**, a list of what the edge class is set to, then **Description and rationale**, then **Evidence**.\n\nThe pieces below are an example (a *supports* edge). Replace them with your own. The page in the Detail view is assembled from them in graph order, and stays current as you edit.\n\nThe Edge Class Template uses this same layout, with the settings taken live from its properties."
        }
      }
    },
